    "text": "<math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#948;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Here, <math><mi>&#956;</mi></math> is refractive index <math><msub><mrow><mi>&#948;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></math> is minimum deviation angle, <math><mi>A</mi></math> is angle of prism.<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>"
